9  THE 285-OF-431 CHANNEL SENTENCE, AGAINST THE TABLE THAT ANSWERS IT
   the Physics Compendium states           285 of 431 channels unverified
   the Spectra Compendium's table holds    126 of 596 rows reading 'untested'
   and states its own extent as            596 rows = 477 + 119
   BOTH NUMBERS OF THE SENTENCE ARE OVERTAKEN.  The denominator moved when
   the parent-term wall and the J-resolved rows landed -- which the Spectra
   Compendium records against itself in the same paragraph as its own count
